''' William Howard Nelson''' (March 9, 1948 – July 29, 2010) was an American professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[defensive tackle]] for the [[Los Angeles Rams]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Oregon State Beavers football|Oregon State Beavers]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/N/NelsBi20.htm |title=Bill Nelson Stats |publisher=Pro-Football-Reference.com |access-date=2019-10-14}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.nfl.com/player/billnelson/2522042/profile |title=Bill Nelson, DT |work=Nfl.com |access-date=2019-10-14}}</ref>

